{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And Joseph gathered up all the silver, etc.</b> Scripture relates this and completes the matter throughout the entire passage to inform us of Joseph's praiseworthy qualities in wisdom, in understanding, and in knowledge, and that he was a faithful man who brought all the silver to the house of Pharaoh and did not make for himself treasuries of silver and hidden stores in the land of Egypt, nor send it to the land of Canaan. Rather, he gave the king, who trusted in him, all the silver, and acquired for him both the land and the persons, and through this he also found favor in the eyes of the people, for HaShem is the One who grants success to those who fear Him."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:45:54.547800461Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}